#~ "propagate without fallback or a provider"
#~ " failure sample. A leaf has no "
#~ "pool-selection capability and cannot carry"
#~ " out `DelegatePool`."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "因此，精确派发仍可以经过子 router 完成准入；指令把该 router 限制在绑定的"
